# A Vessel Without a Captain, Ru'Lude Gardens' trigger area 1 with The Shadow Lord completed
# (mission.cop.a_vessel_without_a_captain#shadow). 3-2 current with Status 1 (a GM) and The Shadow Lord completed:
# the area: 65; finished: the mission completes (3-3 current).
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/65
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=0,3,10 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria TheShadowLord completed
mission Cop AVesselWithoutACaptain current
charvar Mission[6][318]Status 1         # a GM
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 0,3,50                             # trigger area 1: 65
finish                                  # complete: 3-3 current
